  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Latin American Laboratory of Public Policies in Science and Technology II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Latin American Laboratory for Public Policy in Science and Technology seeks to strengthen the areas of education and professional training, research and public management of Science and Technology (S&amp;T) in the region.
Participating governments will train their officials and obtain proposals for improving the programmes they are implementing. Young professionals and researchers will be trained in the design and analysis of public policies for the promotion of science and technology and will document existing experiences in the region.</narrative>
  </description>
